cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CADMIA in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "CADMIA — Computational Agent-Driven Molecular Intelligence Architecture"
abstract: >-
  A modular command-line suite for studying nanocluster reactivity and
  adsorption from quantum-chemistry outputs (ORCA and Gaussian), built around a common data core
  with full scientific traceability: native conceptual-DFT descriptors,
  CDFT-guided adsorption geometries, energetics and thermochemistry,
  electron-density / Fukui / dual-descriptor / MEP maps, and an integrated
  report.
type: software
